{"id":48267,"date":"2026-01-22T20:23:10","date_gmt":"2026-01-22T19:23:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=48267"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:21:21","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:21:21","slug":"meia-maratona-ameal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-ameal\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Ameal 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Ameal 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Ameal 2026<\/strong> (Meia Maratona do Ameal Arte &#038; Meios) realiza-se a <strong>27 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> na vila do <strong>Ameal<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Integrando o Campeonato Distrital de Meia Maratona da ADAC e o Circuito das Estrelas de Portugal, a prova desenrola-se num tra\u00e7ado em asfalto extraordinariamente plano (apenas 66 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado em 21,0975 km), projetado de raiz para os atletas alcan\u00e7arem recordes pessoais.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo da <strong>ARDA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Desportiva do Ameal<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Taveiro, Ameal e Arzila<\/strong> e a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong>, o evento inclui a <strong>Meia Maratona (21.1 km)<\/strong>, a <strong>Mini Meia Maratona (10 km)<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong>, todas com partida e meta junto \u00e0 Pastelaria Sabores do Ameal.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 